/*
 * k1_dtb.h - the compiled SpaceMiT K1 board DTB (k1.dts -> dtc) embedded as a
 * byte array, so the kernel can parse a REAL K1 devicetree through fdt.c even
 * while qemu boots via its own virt DTB (whose device addresses match the
 * EMULATED virt hardware, not K1 silicon). On the physical board U-Boot hands
 * this same K1 blob in a1 (booti a0=hartid, a1=dtb) and the addresses match
 * real K1 devices. Generated from k1.dtb; do not edit by hand.
 *
 * This blob carries the CORRECTED topology (PLIC not AIA, 8 harts,
 * spacemit,k1-x-sdhci, the SpaceMiT UART bind strings, plus emac/pcie/dwc3/
 * ccu/gpu nodes) - see the header of k1.dts for what was wrong before and why
 * it mattered.
 */
